    non-semantic flavors removed, FFI ABI reset to version 1,
    incomplete OTel controls reject-only, trusted_proxies main-only
  * Hybrid zero-copy output path for streaming responses
  * Streaming decompression routing (gzip, deflate, Brotli)
  * Full-buffer compressed copy reduction
  * markdown_auto_decompress directive registration
  * Performance evidence gate chain and benchmark harness
  * Performance doctor advice tool

